  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n6 (1)/(3) - [ (9)/(4) + left{ (5)/(4) - (1)/(13) times ( (5)/(2) - (1)/(3) ) right} ] \n\n**Concept used:**\n\n** [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/694d0d67bc14effd3a3679b70b4d77edef851107a6a53b64ea488e47e4c2bef5.png] **\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n6 (1)/(3) - [ (9)/(4) + left{ (5)/(4) - (1)/(13) times ( (5)/(2) - (1)/(3) ) right} ] \n\n⇒ 6 (1)/(3) - [ (9)/(4) + left{ (5)/(4) - (1)/(13) times ( (15 - 2)/(6) ) right} ] \n\n⇒ 6 (1)/(3) - [ (9)/(4) + left{ (5)/(4) - (1)/(13) times (13)/(6) right} ] \n\n⇒ 6 (1)/(3) - [ (9)/(4) + left{ (5)/(4) - (1)/(6) right} ] \n\n⇒ 6 (1)/(3) - [ (9)/(4) + left{ (15-2)/(12) right} ] \n\n⇒ 6 (1)/(3) - [ (9)/(4) + (13)/(12) ] \n\n⇒ 6 (1)/(3) - [(27+13)/(12) ]\n\n⇒ (19)/(3) - (40)/(12)\n\n⇒ (76-40)/(12)\n\n⇒ (36)/(12)\n\n⇒ 3\n\n**∴ Required answer is 3.**",
